            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"beta-function-from-scale-independence\">Beta function from scale independence</h2></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">For <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(a=g/(16\\pi^2)||)</marimo-tex>, require the bare coupling <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\mu^{2\\epsilon}a Z_g||)</marimo-tex> to be scale independent. Expanding <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(-2\\epsilon aZ_g/(Z_g+a\\partial_a Z_g)||)</marimo-tex> derives the four-dimensional beta function:</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">3\u00b7a\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>17/3\u00b7a\u00b3</div></div>"
          }
